2
00:00:47.356 --> 00:00:50.984
My name is Ash.
and I am a slave.

3
00:00:51.193 --> 00:00:53.987
- Aah !

4
00:00:54.196 --> 00:00:56.823
Close as I can figure it.
the year is 1300 A.D..

5
00:00:57.032 --> 00:00:59.451
and I'm being
dragged to my death.

6
00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.287
It wasn't always
like this.

7
00:01:02.496 --> 00:01:06.208
I had
a real life once.

8
00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:08.627
A job.

9
00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:13.590
Ash to price check four.

10
00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.176
Um. hardware. aisle 12.

11
00:01:16.385 --> 00:01:18.345
Shop smart.
Shop S-mart.

12
00:01:18.553 --> 00:01:23.225
I had a wonderful
girlfriend. Linda.

13
00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.356
Together. we drove to
a small cabin in the mountains.

14
00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.861
It seems an archaeologist
had come to this remote place...

15
00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:37.864
to translate and study
his latest find.

16
00:01:38.073 --> 00:01:41.201
"Necronomicon Ex Mortis."

17
00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.330
"The Book of the Dead."

18
00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:49.001
Bound in human flesh
and inked in blood.

19
00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:53.547
this ancient Sumerian text
contained bizarre burial rites.

20
00:01:53.755 --> 00:01:58.802
funerary incantations
and demon resurrection passages.

21
00:01:59.011 --> 00:02:01.930
It was never meant
for the world of the living.

22
00:02:02.139 --> 00:02:07.269
The book awoke
something dark in the woods.

23
00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:14.735
It took Linda.

24
00:02:14.943 --> 00:02:17.779
- And then it came for me.

25
00:02:17.988 --> 00:02:20.949
It got into my hand
and it went bad.

26
00:02:21.158 --> 00:02:23.577
So I lopped it off
at the wrist.

27
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:32.461
But that didn't stop it.
It came back.

28
00:02:32.669 --> 00:02:36.256
- Big time.

29
00:02:36.465 --> 00:02:38.925
Ah !

30
00:02:39.134 --> 00:02:42.679
Aah !

31
00:02:51.813 --> 00:02:55.108
My God !

32
00:02:55.317 --> 00:02:57.152
How do you stop it ?

33
00:03:53.875 --> 00:03:55.961
- Surround the stranger !

34
00:03:59.047 --> 00:04:01.800
All right.
you men. fall in !

35
00:04:06.388 --> 00:04:08.682
All o' ya. keep a pace !

36
00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:11.935
Where in the hell--

37
00:04:18.859 --> 00:04:20.902
Stand fast. hellhound !

38
00:04:21.111 --> 00:04:24.406
No. no.
Easy now. chief.

39
00:04:24.615 --> 00:04:26.366
Uh. I don't know
how I got here.

40
00:04:26.575 --> 00:04:30.871
- and. uh. uh. I'm not
looking for any trouble.

41
00:04:33.248 --> 00:04:37.336
What a piece of armor this is !

42
00:04:37.586 --> 00:04:40.005
- Wise man !
- Fall back ! Come on. all you men.

43
00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:43.592
Back on your horses.
Come on !

44
00:04:44.301 --> 00:04:48.013
My lord. I believe he is the one
written of in the Necronomicon.

45
00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.515
He who's prophesied to fall
from the heavens...

46
00:04:50.724 --> 00:04:53.518
and deliver us from
the terrors of the Deadites.

47
00:04:53.727 --> 00:04:55.312
What. that buffoon ?

48
00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.856
Likely...

49
00:04:58.065 --> 00:04:59.900
he's one
of Henry's men !

50
00:05:00.108 --> 00:05:04.029
- Kneel. rapscallions !

51
00:05:04.196 --> 00:05:06.907
I say
to the pit with him !

52
00:05:07.115 --> 00:05:11.078
You shall soon
learn the horrors of the pit.

53
00:05:11.286 --> 00:05:14.623
- To the pit !
- You miserable bast--

54
00:05:14.831 --> 00:05:19.878
- Get him !
- Get off of me !

55
00:05:20.504 --> 00:05:23.298
- Let me go !
- Chain him !

56
00:05:25.968 --> 00:05:27.928
Ah. you're gonna have
a little bit of wee fun. mate.

57
00:05:30.305 --> 00:05:33.892
To the castle !

58
00:05:35.143 --> 00:05:38.063
Pick up your feet !
Stop draggin' your feet !

59
00:05:38.272 --> 00:05:40.399
Come on !
Move along !

60
00:05:40.607 --> 00:05:42.567
Come on. now.

61
00:05:42.776 --> 00:05:45.612
Come on. pick it up.
Have a taste of this !

62
00:05:52.869 --> 00:05:55.831
You men got something
to look forward to...

63
00:05:56.039 --> 00:05:59.543
when you get back to the castle.

64
00:05:59.751 --> 00:06:01.545
Lord Arthur approaches !

65
00:06:01.753 --> 00:06:04.631
Raise the portcullis !

66
00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:10.971
Lord Arthur !
Lord Arthur approaches !

67
00:06:14.683 --> 00:06:16.810
That's lovely. isn't it ?
Move it in.

68
00:06:17.019 --> 00:06:20.772
Move it.
you worthless--

69
00:06:20.981 --> 00:06:24.484
- Get on !

70
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:42.586
Move it up. boys.
God save the king !

71
00:06:42.794 --> 00:06:45.547
God save the king.
We love him !

72
00:06:47.883 --> 00:06:51.136
Arthur !
He's back !

73
00:06:51.345 --> 00:06:55.974
Lord Arthur. where is my brother ?
Did he not ride with you ?

74
00:06:56.183 --> 00:06:58.143
Aye.
and fought valiantly.

75
00:06:58.352 --> 00:07:01.730
But last night he fell in battle
to Duke Henry's men.

76
00:07:01.939 --> 00:07:03.982
I'm sorry. Sheila.

77
00:07:04.191 --> 00:07:05.859
Come on.

78
00:07:06.068 --> 00:07:09.321
You cretin !
Ah. stop it. you bastard !

79
00:07:11.531 --> 00:07:13.492
You barbarian !

80
00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.536
- Oh. no ! Stop it ! Stop it !

81
00:07:16.745 --> 00:07:18.914
Get outta here.
you little brat !

82
00:07:22.751 --> 00:07:26.797
Foul thing !
A pox on you. brute !

83
00:07:27.005 --> 00:07:29.925
Thou art a murderer !
A black murderer !

84
00:07:35.138 --> 00:07:37.057
My brother's death
shall be avenged !

85
00:07:51.822 --> 00:07:55.450
Company. halt !

86
00:07:57.619 --> 00:08:01.206
Get that yoke off 'im !

87
00:08:01.915 --> 00:08:04.543
Kill them !

88
00:08:04.751 --> 00:08:06.628
Put them into the pit !

89
00:08:13.552 --> 00:08:17.681
You. sir.
are not one of my vassals.

90
00:08:17.889 --> 00:08:20.100
Who are you ?

91
00:08:20.309 --> 00:08:23.061
Who wants to know ?

92
00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.230
I am Henry the Red.

93
00:08:25.439 --> 00:08:29.776
Duke of Shael. Lord of the Northlands
and leader of its peoples.

94
00:08:29.985 --> 00:08:33.905
Well. hello.
Mr. Fancy Pants.

95
00:08:34.114 --> 00:08:36.950
I got news for you. pal. You ain't
leadin' but two things right now--

96
00:08:37.159 --> 00:08:39.995
Jack and shit.
and Jack left town.

97
00:08:40.203 --> 00:08:41.330
Shut your bleedin' hole !

98
00:08:41.538 --> 00:08:42.914
Shut your bleedin' hole !

99
00:08:43.123 --> 00:08:46.710
Gentlemen. Lord Arthur !

100
00:08:53.091 --> 00:08:56.553
There is an evil
awakened in this land.

101
00:08:56.762 --> 00:09:00.307
and while my people fight
for their very souls against it.

102
00:09:00.515 --> 00:09:03.310
you. Henry the Red.
wage war on us !

103
00:09:03.518 --> 00:09:07.522
Charlatan !
Aah !

104
00:09:07.731 --> 00:09:10.442
It was you who first turned
your swords on us !

105
00:09:10.651 --> 00:09:13.528
And this evil has befouled
my people as well !

106
00:09:13.737 --> 00:09:16.531
Your people are no better
than the foul corruption...

107
00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.659
that lies in the bowels of that pit.

108
00:09:18.867 --> 00:09:21.620
Right. you're no better.

109
00:09:21.828 --> 00:09:24.164
May God
have mercy upon your souls.

110
00:09:38.303 --> 00:09:43.642
God's name !
What hell-spawned thing lurks there ?

111
00:09:47.562 --> 00:09:51.191
Into the pit with those
bloodthirsty sons of 'hores !

112
00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:55.612
No ! No !

113
00:09:55.737 --> 00:09:58.657
No. no ! Aah !

114
00:10:25.475 --> 00:10:29.521
Oh ! Heavenly God !

115
00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:33.483
He's escaping !

116
00:10:33.692 --> 00:10:37.362
- Hold to !
- Hold him !

117
00:11:07.476 --> 00:11:09.603
- Who's next ?
- It's him. Aye. he trembles !

118
00:11:09.811 --> 00:11:13.148
They don't look
so clever now. do they ?

119
00:11:13.357 --> 00:11:17.694
He's frightened !
He's frightened white !

120
00:11:17.903 --> 00:11:20.072
Whoa ! Whoa !

121
00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:23.033
Wait a minute. Hold it.

122
00:11:23.241 --> 00:11:27.621
W-Wait a minute.
You gotta understand. man.

123
00:11:27.829 --> 00:11:30.290
I never even saw
these assholes before.

124
00:11:30.499 --> 00:11:32.459
- Get him in there !
- He trembles !

125
00:11:32.668 --> 00:11:34.586
He's begging !

126
00:11:34.795 --> 00:11:37.255
- What are you waitin' for ?
- Henry !

127
00:11:37.464 --> 00:11:39.299
You gotta tell him
you don't know me.

128
00:11:39.508 --> 00:11:43.720
We never met.
Tell him.

129
00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:48.475
I do not think
he'll listen. lad.

130
00:11:48.684 --> 00:11:49.810
Look.

131
00:11:50.018 --> 00:11:54.773
I'm tellin' you.
you got the wrong guy.

132
00:12:03.365 --> 00:12:07.452
I'm tellin' you.
you got the wrong guy.

133
00:12:07.661 --> 00:12:11.248
Uh. wh-whoa.

134
00:12:11.665 --> 00:12:13.792
- Aah !

135
00:13:02.758 --> 00:13:06.970
How do you like the pit ?
Isn't the pit wonderful ?

136
00:13:20.108 --> 00:13:22.194
- Hai-ya !

137
00:13:22.402 --> 00:13:26.323
- Why. you--

138
00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.076
Ha !

139
00:13:29.284 --> 00:13:31.119
Spikes.

140
00:13:31.328 --> 00:13:35.791
Hey ! He says. "Spikes."
Give him spikes !

141
00:13:48.261 --> 00:13:52.557
Make way !
Strange one !

142
00:14:01.942 --> 00:14:05.279
- Strange one !

143
00:14:07.114 --> 00:14:10.659
Yaaah !

144
00:14:10.867 --> 00:14:14.746
Yes !

145
00:14:27.467 --> 00:14:30.679
Damn you.
Damn you !

146
00:15:55.305 --> 00:15:59.309
You know.
your shoelace is untied.

147
00:16:08.819 --> 00:16:11.363
All right.

148
00:16:11.571 --> 00:16:14.283
Who wants some ?

149
00:16:14.491 --> 00:16:17.953
Who's next. huh ?

150
00:16:18.161 --> 00:16:20.038
How 'bout it ?

151
00:16:20.247 --> 00:16:22.624
Who wants some. huh ?

152
00:16:22.833 --> 00:16:26.712
Who wants
to have a little ?

153
00:16:29.089 --> 00:16:34.011
You.
You want some more ?

154
00:16:34.386 --> 00:16:37.514
Huh ?

155
00:16:37.597 --> 00:16:41.268
You want a little ?

156
00:16:41.852 --> 00:16:44.563
Do ya ? Do ya ?
Do ya want some more?

157
00:16:44.771 --> 00:16:48.942
Huh ? Huh ?

158
00:17:01.288 --> 00:17:05.876
Now get on those horses
and get outta here.

159
00:17:07.961 --> 00:17:11.131
Let 'em go !

160
00:17:32.235 --> 00:17:34.988
- Halt !

161
00:17:35.197 --> 00:17:38.450
Thank you. generous hosts !

162
00:17:38.659 --> 00:17:42.079
Sword boy !

163
00:17:48.377 --> 00:17:53.465
For that arrogance.
I shall see you dead.

164
00:18:02.724 --> 00:18:04.643
Yeah.

165
00:18:04.851 --> 00:18:08.689
All right. you primitive screwheads.
listen up.

166
00:18:08.897 --> 00:18:11.066
See this ?

167
00:18:11.275 --> 00:18:15.946
