168
00:18:16.154 --> 00:18:18.490
It's a 12-gauge.
double-barreled Remington.

169
00:18:18.699 --> 00:18:20.575
S-mart's
top of the line.

170
00:18:20.784 --> 00:18:23.704
You can find this in
the sporting goods department.

171
00:18:23.912 --> 00:18:27.207
That's right. This sweet baby
was made in Grand Rapids. Michigan.

172
00:18:27.416 --> 00:18:30.711
Retails for about $109.95.

173
00:18:30.919 --> 00:18:35.632
It's got a walnut stock.
cobalt blue steel and a hair trigger.

174
00:18:35.841 --> 00:18:39.136
That's right. shop smart.

175
00:18:39.344 --> 00:18:42.389
Shop S-mart.
You got that ?

176
00:18:42.597 --> 00:18:44.391
- Yes. sir. Right.
- Yes. sir.

177
00:18:44.599 --> 00:18:46.602
Now I swear.

178
00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.896
the next one
of you primates...

179
00:18:50.105 --> 00:18:53.775
even touches me--

180
00:19:20.469 --> 00:19:25.557
Now. let's talk about
how I get back home.

181
00:19:56.046 --> 00:19:58.590
I prithee to forgive me.
m'lord.

182
00:19:58.799 --> 00:20:01.468
I believed thee
one of Henry's men.

183
00:20:01.677 --> 00:20:05.681
First you wanna kill me.
now you wanna kiss me.

184
00:20:06.348 --> 00:20:08.266
Blow.

185
00:20:10.727 --> 00:20:13.855
So what's the deal ?
Can you send me back or not ?

186
00:20:14.064 --> 00:20:16.608
Only the Necronomicon
has the power.

187
00:20:16.817 --> 00:20:18.944
An unholy book
which we also require.

188
00:20:19.152 --> 00:20:22.739
Within its pages are passages
that can send you back to your time.

189
00:20:22.948 --> 00:20:26.743
Only you. The Promised One.
can quest for it.

190
00:20:26.952 --> 00:20:30.205
I don't want your book.
I don't want your bullshit.

191
00:20:30.414 --> 00:20:35.627
Just send me back to my own time.
Pronto. today. chop--

192
00:20:43.051 --> 00:20:46.596
- You shall die !

193
00:20:52.936 --> 00:20:56.523
You shall never obtain
the Necronomicon !

194
00:20:56.732 --> 00:21:01.028
We shall feast
upon your souls !

195
00:21:04.197 --> 00:21:07.993
Oh !

196
00:21:22.049 --> 00:21:26.178
- It's a trick. Get an axe.

197
00:21:30.766 --> 00:21:34.394
- Guards. stop it !

198
00:21:34.603 --> 00:21:37.064
- Catch the witch !
- Death to the witch !

199
00:21:37.272 --> 00:21:39.191
Have some porridge !

200
00:21:39.399 --> 00:21:42.569
Ah. my eyes ! I'm blind !
Oh. God. I'm blind !

201
00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:46.615
No. don't !

202
00:21:51.161 --> 00:21:53.956
Yo. she-bitch.

203
00:21:54.164 --> 00:21:56.917
- Let's go.

204
00:21:57.125 --> 00:21:58.710
Ya-hoo !

205
00:21:58.919 --> 00:22:01.088
Hee-ya !

206
00:22:01.296 --> 00:22:04.716
- Hee-ya !

207
00:22:18.438 --> 00:22:20.691
If the Necronomicon fell into
the hands of the Deadites.

208
00:22:20.899 --> 00:22:23.568
all mankind will be consumed
by this evil.

209
00:22:23.777 --> 00:22:27.489
Now will thou
quest for the book ?

210
00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:43.547
That one.

211
00:23:02.149 --> 00:23:05.068
Hee-ya !

212
00:23:08.447 --> 00:23:11.825
Groovy.

213
00:23:23.128 --> 00:23:26.381
What's the matter ?
You raised in a barn ? Shut the door.

214
00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:31.803
Probably was raised in a barn
with all the other primitives.

215
00:23:39.144 --> 00:23:43.607
The wise men say that
thou art The Promised One.

216
00:23:45.651 --> 00:23:49.237
'Tis said that thou wilt journey
for the book to help us.

217
00:23:49.446 --> 00:23:51.698
and that thou wilt lead
our people against the evil.

218
00:23:51.907 --> 00:23:57.245
The only reason I'm going
to get the book is to get home.

219
00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:03.877
I believe that thou wilt be
leaving in the morning.

220
00:24:04.086 --> 00:24:06.129
Don't touch that. please.
Your primitive intellect...

221
00:24:06.338 --> 00:24:08.215
wouldn't understand
alloys and compositions...

222
00:24:08.423 --> 00:24:13.261
and things with
molecular structures in the--

223
00:24:14.262 --> 00:24:16.932
What are you
doin' here anyway ?

224
00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:19.643
I wanted to say
that all of my--

225
00:24:19.851 --> 00:24:22.187
all of my hopes and
prayers go with you.

226
00:24:22.396 --> 00:24:25.232
and I made this
for thee.

227
00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:28.860
Good. I could use
a horse blanket.

228
00:24:50.132 --> 00:24:53.677
Gimme some sugar. baby.

229
00:25:01.977 --> 00:25:06.565
Hyah ! Come on. boy !

230
00:25:06.940 --> 00:25:10.319
Hyah !

231
00:25:15.699 --> 00:25:19.703
Hyah !

232
00:25:26.126 --> 00:25:28.295
- Steady now. Whoa.

233
00:25:33.175 --> 00:25:35.636
What ? What is it ?

234
00:25:35.844 --> 00:25:38.430
This path will lead you
to an unholy place.

235
00:25:38.639 --> 00:25:43.936
A cemetery. There.
the Necronomicon awaits.

236
00:25:45.896 --> 00:25:49.983
When thou retrievest the book from
its cradle. you must recite the words.

237
00:25:50.192 --> 00:25:52.986
"Klaatu barada nikto."

238
00:25:53.195 --> 00:25:56.782
Klaatu barada nikto.
Okay.

239
00:25:56.990 --> 00:25:58.992
Well. repeat them.

240
00:25:59.201 --> 00:26:02.454
- Klaatu barada nikto.
- Again !

241
00:26:02.663 --> 00:26:05.999
I got it. I got it !
I know your damn words. all right ?

242
00:26:06.208 --> 00:26:08.710
Now you get this straight.
the both of you.

243
00:26:08.919 --> 00:26:11.797
If I get that book.
you send me back.

244
00:26:12.005 --> 00:26:14.299
After that.
I'm history. Hyah !

245
00:26:54.881 --> 00:26:56.758
What is it. boy ?

246
00:27:09.980 --> 00:27:12.858
Hyah ! Come on !

247
00:27:20.490 --> 00:27:23.452
Hyah ! Come on !

248
00:27:28.457 --> 00:27:31.376
Aah ! Come on !

249
00:27:31.585 --> 00:27:34.713
Come on. you !

250
00:29:18.525 --> 00:29:22.613
Hey. let's scare
this guy good ! Come on.

251
00:29:24.114 --> 00:29:26.116
Ramming speed !

252
00:29:30.621 --> 00:29:33.999
Ooh !

253
00:29:34.207 --> 00:29:37.002
Ready. aim. fire !

254
00:29:37.210 --> 00:29:39.880
- Ooh !
- Get away !

255
00:29:40.088 --> 00:29:42.007
